        },
        {
          "text": "Azini mi fe ru mini ma so pa kirikiri, ovuzu inzizaru ambo ’dani ’dani, kini, Yehova asikari ongulumuruniri eri Mungu Israelini, e, Mungu Israe­liniri’i; azini Daudi ati’bo miniri ma jodrini pa so kirikiri mi ma miliani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
